From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:36:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: apple,t8140-pmp-report: add
 apple,t8132-pmp-v2-report

The M4 (T8132) PMP report has the T8140 request windows (read at
0x1880, update at 0x10000 + 0xc40) and its own acknowledgment offset
(0x1900). Its devices are reported through the same entries. Allow the
T8132 compatible on the T8140 report binding.

Signed-off-by: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit a3260c6b914c87bec0acdc01f7d87e1fe9f683f7)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml   | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml
index c68354b996..2e19bbc80e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/power/apple,t8140-pmp-report.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Apple T8140 PMP report aperture
+title: Apple T8132 and T8140 PMP report aperture
 
 maintainers:
   - Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
@@ -19,7 +19,9 @@ description: |
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-pmp-v2-report
+    enum:
+      - apple,t8132-pmp-v2-report
+      - apple,t8140-pmp-v2-report
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
